{
  "id": "dmw7wegt7f5zk",
  "name": "日期选择器",
  "tags": [
    "展开",
    "日期"
  ],
  "summary": "按钮显示当前日期，点开展开月历；选中某天立即回填并自动收起。",
  "usage": "表单里选单个日期（生日、截止日、预约日）；需要选一段时间用「日期范围」。",
  "caution": "单日选择别用双日历；跨时区的业务要明确用哪一天的哪个时刻；日期范围用另一个设计。",
  "hint": "点按钮展开日历，选一天自动收起",
  "prompt": "【日期选择器】目标：按钮上显示日期，点开在下方展开月历（表头可切月、星期行、日期网格），点某一天立即回填按钮并自动收起。\n\n1) 结构：.trigger（日历图标 + 日期文字 + chevron）+ .panel（月历）。月历 = .head（‹ 2026年11月 ›）+ .week（日一二三四五六）+ .grid（7 列 × 6 行）。\n\n2) 日期生成：`new Date(y, m, 1).getDay()` 得到首日星期偏移，`new Date(y, m+1, 0).getDate()` 得到当月天数；前面补空格子，后面补齐到 7 的倍数。\n\n3) 选中：点某天 → 写回 trigger 文本（格式 YYYY-MM-DD）→ 关闭面板。**选完自动收起**是它和筛选面板最大的区别——单值选择没有「确定」这一步。\n\n4) 今天用品牌色描边标识，选中日用实心品牌色圆点；hover 用 surface-2。\n\n5) 切月：‹ › 按钮改 month，重新渲染；不要禁用跨年切换。\n\n6) 无障碍：trigger aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" + aria-expanded；月历 role=\"dialog\"；日期用 button + aria-pressed。\n\n7) 坑：日期网格要用 `grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr)`，否则数字对不齐；空格子用空的 div 占位；面板绝对定位在按钮下方并注意视口边界。\n\n8) 配色：选中日品牌色；今天用品牌色描边；非本月日期可以淡化或省略。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点按钮 → 展开 → 点 15 号 → 收起并回填）；弹窗里只绑真实点击。\n\n10) 使用场景：表单选单个日期；选区间用「日期范围」。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}\n\n.wrap{position:relative}\n\n.trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:9px;\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.trigger:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border))}\n.trigger svg{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.trigger .chev{color:var(--ui-text-dim);transition:transform .2s ease}\n.wrap.open .trigger{border-color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,var(--ui-surface))}\n.wrap.open .trigger .chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n\n.panel{position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(100% + 8px);width:226px;border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 18px 44px color-mix(in srgb,#000 18%,transparent);\n  padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.wrap.open .panel{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.head b{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.head button{width:20px;height:20px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px;line-height:1;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.head button:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n\n.week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px}\n.week span{text-align:center;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);padding:2px 0}\n\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:1px}\n.day{aspect-ratio:1;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;\n  transition:background .12s ease,color .12s ease,box-shadow .12s ease}\n.day:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.day.today{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 55%,transparent)}\n.day.sel{background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font-weight:600}\n.day.blank{pointer-events:none}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  /* 卡片只有 176px 高：按钮靠上，日历压扁（日期用固定高度而不是等比） */\n  body{padding:10px;align-items:flex-start}\n  .wrap{margin-top:5px}\n  .trigger{font-size:10px;padding:5px 10px}\n  .panel{width:212px;padding:7px;gap:4px}\n  .head b{font-size:10px}\n  .head button{width:17px;height:17px;font-size:11px}\n  .week span{font-size:8px;padding:1px 0}\n  .grid{gap:0}\n  .day{aspect-ratio:auto;height:19px;font-size:9px;border-radius:5px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .trigger,.panel,.chev,.day{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\">\n  <button class=\"trigger\" id=\"trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9.5h17M8 3v4M16 3v4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n    <span id=\"label\">2026-11-08</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 4.6 L6 7.4 L9 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择日期\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <button id=\"prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"上个月\">‹</button>\n      <b id=\"title\">2026 年 11 月</b>\n      <button id=\"next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"下个月\">›</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"week\"><span>日</span><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span></div>\n    <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('wrap'),\n      trigger = document.getElementById('trigger'),\n      panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      grid = document.getElementById('grid'),\n      title = document.getElementById('title'),\n      label = document.getElementById('label'),\n      prev = document.getElementById('prev'),\n      next = document.getElementById('next');\n\n  var year = 2026, month = 10;\n  var selected = '2026-11-08';\n  var open = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function pad(n){ return n < 10 ? '0' + n : '' + n; }\n\n  function render(){\n    title.textContent = year + ' 年 ' + (month + 1) + ' 月';\n    grid.innerHTML = '';\n\n    var firstDay = new Date(year, month, 1).getDay();\n    var days = new Date(year, month + 1, 0).getDate();\n\n    for(var i = 0; i < firstDay; i++){\n      var b = document.createElement('span');\n      b.className = 'day blank';\n      grid.appendChild(b);\n    }\n    for(var d = 1; d <= days; d++){\n      var btn = document.createElement('button');\n      btn.className = 'day';\n      btn.type = 'button';\n      btn.textContent = String(d);\n      btn.setAttribute('data-d', d);\n      var iso = year + '-' + pad(month + 1) + '-' + pad(d);\n      if(iso === selected) btn.classList.add('sel');\n      if(iso === '2026-11-08') btn.classList.add('today');\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        selected = year + '-' + pad(month + 1) + '-' + pad(Number(this.getAttribute('data-d')));\n        label.textContent = selected;\n        setOpen(false);\n        render();\n      });\n      grid.appendChild(btn);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function setOpen(on){\n    open = on;\n    wrap.classList.toggle('open', on);\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n\n  trigger.addEventListener('click', function(){ setOpen(!open); });\n  panel.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });\n\n  prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ month--; if(month < 0){ month = 11; year--; } render(); });\n  next.addEventListener('click', function(){ month++; if(month > 11){ month = 0; year++; } render(); });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') setOpen(false); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function tap(c, el, cb){\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){ c.release(); cb(); }, 170);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setOpen(false);\n    selected = '2026-11-08';\n    label.textContent = selected;\n    year = 2026; month = 10;\n    render();\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    tap(c, trigger, function(){\n      setOpen(true);\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        var d15 = grid.querySelector('[data-d=\"15\"]');\n        tap(c, d15, function(){\n          d15.click();\n          if(c.hide) c.hide();\n        });\n      }, 600);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4600); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  render();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
